SUMMARY:NOMD — Global Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: NOMAD FOODS BONDCO PLC (NOMD)\nRoadshow: www.netroadshow.com/nrs/h
 ome/#!/?show=55fab390 or visit www.netroadshow.com and enter the entry cod
 e: NOMD26\n\nDeal context:\nNomad Foods Bondco plc is launching a €800 mil
 lion Senior Secured Fixed Rate Notes offering with a 7-year tenor\, struct
 ured as a full refinancing of its existing €800 million 2.5% Senior Secure
 d Notes due 2028. The deal is distributed on a RegS / 144A For Life basis\
 , listed on TISE\, and governed by New York Law\, with Jefferies acting as
  Lead Left and B&D. The transaction features NC3 call protection with a de
 clining schedule (50% / 25% / Par) and carries existing corporate ratings 
 of B1 / BB- / BB (Moody's / S&P / Fitch)\, firmly placing it in the High Y
 ield space.
